suppress.notes:
FALSE POSITIVE: CVE-2024-35255 (Azure Identity / MSAL elevation of privilege).
NVD limits the Java entry to MSAL for Java < 1.15.1 (https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-35255);
MSRC lists azure-identity for Java as fixed in 1.12.2. We ship azure-identity 1.18.x and msal4j 1.23.x.
